  "benefits_features_and_faqs": {
    "about_overview": "HDFC Diners Club Privilege Credit Card is a good choice for people looking for lifestyle benefits across everyday spending categories like dining, shopping, and movies. Cardholders can earn accelerated rewards on popular brands like Zomato & Swiggy, quarterly milestone benefits from Decathlon and Marriott, and the Buy One, Get One offer on BookMyShow. The card also offers up to 10X rewards on SmartBuy, giving users a reward rate of up to 13.33% on accelerated categories and 1.33% as a base rate.",
